Mon Oct  5 06:44:36 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <martin@pluskal.org>

- Update to 0.15:
  * Add bugz search -k/--keywords to restrict by keywords, all of
    which must match
  * bugz --columns 0 now prints untruncated lines instead of empty
    ones
  * Close file handles with "with", so descriptors are released
    when a read or write fails
- Add pybugz-version.patch, as the 0.15 tag left __version__ at
  0.14 and flit takes the wheel version from it.
- Switch from update-alternatives to libalternatives; man bugz now
  resolves through alts instead of a packaged symlink.
- Add a %check that imports the installed bugz module and asserts
  its version.
- Drop obsolete Group tags.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Thu Jun  5 02:52:33 UTC 2025 - Steve Kowalik <steven.kowalik@suse.com>

- Update to 0.14:
  * Add --interactive command line switch for username and password prompts
  * add support for searching for addresses in CC field
  * Use mimetype of encoding if there is one
  * utils: use builtin way to get terminal width
  * change build system to flit
  * fix output of UTF-8 characters in limited locales
  * fix multiple warnings
  * remove unused readline import
- Switch to pyproject macros.
- Specify module directories explicitly.

